# `build:single` inlines index.html verbatim into hitstop.html, so the two
# must agree on line endings or every rebuild produces a spurious 25-line
# diff across the wrapper — on a repo whose rule 5 says to rebuild the
# committed bundle on every game change, that noise is constant.
#
# Pinned to CRLF, which is what the committed bundle already carries.
# Stored LF, checked out CRLF on every platform, so the build reads CRLF
# and writes CRLF wherever it runs.
index.html   text eol=crlf
hitstop.html text eol=crlf
